  <para style="h">Ifuso Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ifuso Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ifuso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ifs</para>
  <para style="mt">Ifuso Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Hudai isighala Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de shitu danlasan <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Ifuso</char>ni Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i shixinji daghasan shentulade xin huaizho. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Mai ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihani Tungo Giezhi Iresan Fuqi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani ada Hudai kuaindu. Hhe Mexihai miende matande asiman jiereshiku yanyanji ruhhertu gounii ogizho. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Duyai zhayaghaku melie orekughala Mexihai miende matai sunghuzhi goyane melie zhiguishighazhi jienjien witui gholughane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Goya isighalane bayasuzhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi matai goyane kewosi danlaghakui eqie jinjiwo. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Oresan kewonne nenjienghalane matande belien ogiwo. Ingiese Hudai famatu nenjienni matai kuaighane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Mexihai miende fugie nenjienghalane Kewonne chusunyi jiageghala matai shuizhi codasanni mienliewo. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Ene nenjienyi soyuji agheli cunminghala hhantu matande pojiezhi olon ogiwo. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Matande jihuane mimii mejieghawo. Eneshi Hudai gou duran wo. Mexihai miende chenjighane giesan wo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Ene jihuashi shihou kurukude asiman, zemin jieredu yanyanjilai man Mexihai miende hhantulaghane. <verse eid="EPH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Pse matan Mexihai miende nexianyi jienliewo. Eneshi duranghalane yanniliuzhe giesan Huda goya jihuaghalane eqie jinjisan wo. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Ingiekushi bijien zui melieshida xiwonni Mexihai jiere teisan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai Hudai famani kuaighane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Taye zhenzhenji daoli, jiushi tai jiuiku gouxioxii chenliedene Mexihani xianxin giese Huda dain giesan Shenlinni tande ogizhi zhanzi taiwo. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Ene Shenlinshi matan jiachanni jienlieku yajin wo, matai shuizhi Hudai bexin gholughane, hhei famani kuaighane.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baoloni Onxian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Ingiese ta Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giezhi soyuji shentulade oresei bi chenliedene <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>onxian giekude tai jilazhi ese beidene tande oluzhi Hudade mafan kieliezho. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Bi tande mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai Huda, famatu Ada aghelitu ruhher pse mejieghaku ruhherni tande ogizhi ta hhei tani, <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>tai zhugheni nudunlai gieghereghazhi hhe tai uruzhi iresan xiwonshi yan bikui, pse shentulai dundadu hhei famatu jiachan matu olon bikui ta mejie, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>pse Huda fugie lilianghalane matan xianxin giesan kunlade xienjighasan hhei nenli matu fugie bikui mejie giezhi onxian giezho. Ene nenlishi <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>Mexihai jiere giesan tebieji fugie lilian wo. Hhei fugusan kun dundase aminne olughazhi asiman jiere goya borun miendene soughazhi <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>yanyanji gonjisan, qienli bareisan, nenlitu, lindao danlasan, zinie edeku pusho, houshidedu yan nierelase da famashighawo. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Pse soyujilai Mexihai kon doura teizhi hhei jiohuini qiorun danlaghadene soyujilai gonjighazho. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Jiohuishi hhei beye wo. Soyujilai dunda soyujilai hulunshighasan Mexiha jiohuini hulunshighazho.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Fugusanse Amiturawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Eqighandei ta codasan dunda zui dundane fuguzho. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Hhe shihoude ta ene duyai xigonyi daghazhi asimanyi doghun lilianyi gonjisan hhei daghazhi zui dunda udu daozho. Hhe jiushi kielienyi ulie chenliechen kunlai sudoro wilie giesan ruhher wo. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Eqighandei matan man hhela mutun mai beyei nefuxinyi daghazhi udu daozho. Zui gieku duran, sumuladanni daghazhi giezho. Matan kunlare niekielien wo, olu bouzheghase Huda faichen kun wo. <verse eid="EPH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Ingieliuzhe Hudade olon ubali xiiku wine, hhe matande oresan fugie orekughala <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>matan codasan dunda fugukudeni matanyi Mexihare hhantu aminne olughawo. Tai jiuikushi nenjienghala wo. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende matanyi Mexihare hhantu aminne olughadene asiman jiere hhere hhantu soughawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Ingiezhi giekushi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende matande renyide ogisan hhei nenjien zhenzhen olon bikui jianlaiku kunlade man uzheghane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Tai jiuikushi nenjienghala wo, xianxin giedene jiuiwo. Eneshi goyase iresan pusho, Huda ogisan mure wo. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Giekughala pusho, pse goyane kuaine. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Matanshi Huda giesan wo, gou wilie gieghane giezhi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende zhayaghasan wo. Eneshi Huda matande matugie udu dao giezhi eqighan jihua gie goudaghasan wo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihai Tungo Giezhi Heqishiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Ingiese ta jila, beyeghala kieliese eqighandei tashi niman kun wo. Hhezighan beye jiere kunni khaghala hetoune giesan kunla tai hetoune ese giesan kun giezhi uruzho. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Hhe shihoude tande Mexiha uwo, <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun ese danlaghazho, Huda yenjisan kielienghala gonxi uwo, duyade yama xiwon uwo, Hudaye uwo. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Eqighandei Hudase gholodosan ta ede Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende hhei chusunde kouizhi Hudare chadashiwo.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Mexihashi matanyi heqishighachen wo. Hhe beyene fugughazhi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun niman kunyi dundadu danni unaghazhi chouni widaghawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni guijinni minlin, kuichenlai widaghadene goyane sudoro <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, niman kun ghualai nie shini kun gholughazhi heqishighawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Shizijiai tungo giezhi chouni widaghazhi ghualai nie beye gholughadene Hudare goudaghawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Da iredene heqishighaku gouxioxii ta gholodedu niman kunlade chonjizhi ogiwo, chadadedu <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunladeye chonjizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Ingiedene Mexihai tungo giezhi matan man nie Shenlinghala Hudai shida echi shidane.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Ingiese ede tashi niman kun, wigo kun pusho, shentulare nie gojia kun gholuzhi mechini kun wo. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Tashi shitu, xienzhilani jichu jiere beighasan gie wo, Mexiha goyaneshi gieni jichu tashi wo. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Mexihai kouizhi nie gie man lienjidene fugiedazhi Ezhanni zhiguitu dajien gholuzho. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Mexihai kouizhi taiye hhantu beighazho. Ene gieshi Huda Shenlinyi tungo giezhi souku oron wo.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Niman Kunlade Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Ingiese Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i yenyinghala ta niman kunlade oluzhi bafanzi sousan bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> tande oluzhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Huda tande oluzhi nenjienghalane made nie tebieji renwu ogisei ta kenjin chenliezhi daozho. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Huda mimii made qinsi mejieghawo. Enei bi eqighandei jiendanghan huaizhi daozho. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Ta onshise bi Mexihani mimii dunjiresanyi mejiene. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ene mimii isii Huda ede Shenlinyi tungo giezhi zhiguitu shitu, xienzhiladene mejieghasan mutun eqighanku xienzidedu kunde ese mejieghazho. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Ene mimishi niman kunla gouxioxii tungo giezhi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende hhantu caichanyi jienliechen danlazhi nie beyeni iyanzi gholuzhi hhantu Huda dain giesanyi jienliene. <verse eid="EPH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Hudai nenjienghala bi gouxioxide hoji danlazho. Huda nenlighalane made ene nenlini ogizho. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Shentulai dundadu zui ganise da gajitu made Huda nenjien ogizhi Mexihani mejiezhi baragha daku olonnii niman kunlade chonji giezho. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Pse soyujilai zhayaghasan Hudai sudoro eqighanse izhi niuighasan mimitu jihuai olon kunlade man minbai olugha giezho. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Ingiekushi ede jiohuii tungo giezhi asiman jiere gonjisan, qienli bareisanlade Hudai yanyanji aghelilai mejieghane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Eneshi mai Ezhan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi gholusan Hudai chanqiku jihua wo. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Matan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro hhei xianxin giezhi danzine fugiedaghazhi ulie inxin giedene Hudai melie echine. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Ingiese bi tai xiahua gieye, bi tande oluzhi shouku giewo giezhi yuchou bu gie. Eneshi tai kuaikui wo.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baoloni Onxian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Ingiese bi Adai melie xiutuliezhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Hheshi asiman, zemin jieredu soyuji jiawulade man niere ogisan wo. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Hhe zhao goya olon fama, Shenlinne tungo giezhi tai sudorodu xianxin gieku zhugheni lilianghala khiduzhegha gie. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Xianxin giekughala Mexiha tai zhughede souzhi tai oreku dunda genzi bareighazhi undanlagha gie. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Ingie tande nenli bizhi soyuji shentulare Mexihani oreku matu aghui, fudu, undu, gun bikui goude mejieghadene <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>hhei oreku kunni sumulakuse daosanyi tande mejieghazhi Hudai hulunshighakughala tai hulunshigha gie.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Nenlini matanyi dunda ochirazhi matan xiahua giezhi sumulasanse pse olon chenjighasan Hudade <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>jiohui, Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi zuzubeibei chanqi izhi kuaikui ogi. Amine!<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Mexihani Sudoro Heqishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Ingiese Ezhande oluzhi bafanzi sousan bi tai sidaghaye, ta yan giese zhao Huda tai urusan mutun gie. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Yandeliuzhe goyane meilade uzhezhi renyide gie. Rennai giezhi oreku zhugheghala nieniedene ranji. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Heqighala nieniene lienjizhi Shenlin tonjie gieghasanni xiacha giezhi barei. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Tai urukude nie xiwonde urusan mutun nie beye, nie Shenlin, <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>nie Ezhan, nie xianxin gieku, nie xili gieku, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>nie Huda wo. Hheshi soyujilai ada wo, soyujilai jiere soyujilai dunda soyujilai sudoro wo.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Matan jien kunde Mexiha ghughazhi ogisan nenli wine. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Ingiese jinwun jiere kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">"Hhe undude khireikude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">olon duitoulane barei khireiwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">kunlade nenlilai ogiwo."<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Hhe khireiwo giezhi ene kielienshi yan isi wo? Hhe xien doura, jiushi zemin jiere bouzhesan pushonu? <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Bouzhesan hheshi zui undu asimande khireisan Hhe wo. Ingiezhi giekushi soyujilai hulunshighane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Kun dunda niezhanlade shitu, xienzhi, gouxioxi chonjichen, mushi, loushi danlaku nenlini ogisanshi Mexiha wo. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Ingiezhi giekushi Mexihani wiliede oluzhi shentulai goude zhunbei gieghadene Mexihani beyeni hendaghane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Izhi ingiezhi giezhi matan dajiala Hudai kewonyi xianxin giezhi taniku jiere nie gholudene fugiedazhi Mexihani hulunnide daine. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Ingiese matan pse kewosi ulie danlazhi kunlai doghun muji, piendaku guijijighala yanyanji xiejioni inxianyi shouizhi eneman, hheman ulie gojioludene <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>oreku zhugheghala shuhua kieliezhi go fanmiende touzi danlasan Mexiha mutun hendane. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Mexihai kouizhi nie beyei sidasunla man chigharade lienjizho. Go iyanzi zoinlane khizheghazhi nie beyeni oreku dunda fugiedazhi hendaghazho.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shini Kunni Musi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Ingiese bi enei Ezhanni miende tande khidunde kielieye. Pse niman kunla mutun qingiezhi udu bu dao. Hhelai sumuladan yama oronde uwo, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>zhugheni kharalazho. Hhela yama ulie mejiezhi zhughene khiduzheghase Huda ogisan aminse danlinrazho. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Hhela shizhekui mejie dazhi hu giedene nefuxinghala yanyanji zannanni giene. <verse eid="EPH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Ta Mexihase surusanshi intui pusho. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Zhendao <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro wo. Ta <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani chenliezhi hhense suruse <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>khuichen kunni teizhi eqighanku xigonlai widagha. Eneshi nefuxin miidene qida olusan wo. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Ta zhughe, sumulakune shinishighazhi <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Hudai yanzi mutun zhenzhenji gundan, ganjinde zhayaghasan shini kunni musi.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shini Udu Daoku Guijin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Ingiese ta pse ghudan bu kielie. Jien kun kunlade shuhua kielie. Matanshi nie beye jieredu iyanzi wo. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Hokuse zui bu fanji, hokuzhi naran bu puda. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Pse Ibiliside jihui ogine. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Ghulachenla pse bu ghula. Goyade iresei nanxin kunlade ghughazhi ogine giezhi qinsi zhendande wilie gie. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Zannan kielienni nie amanda bu khizheghazhi heshide kunlade banjiku kielien kielie. Ingiese chenliesan kunde haochu wine. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Hudai Shenlinni yuchou bu giegha. Hhe shuiku udude oluzhi tai jiere hhei zhanzii taizho. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Yanyanji henjiku, piqi shuaiku, hokuku, nouiku, kufurei fanjiku, pse mouxiennilai man tai dundase widagha. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Huda Mexihai miende tai rouliesan mutun taye renyitu zhugheghala ubali xiizhi nieniene roulie.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Ingiese ta Hudai daghazhi suru, tashi Huda oresan kewosi wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Mexiha matande orezhi matande goyane sheidene Hudade ogisan andatu dunxi, mure danlazhi Hudade ogisan mutun taye yan giese oreku zhugheghala gie.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Lon kijieku, yanyanji zannanni gieku, tanxin giekulai tai dunda qiizhi da ulie olune. Shentula ingiezhi giese heshi uwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Shizheku kielien, hu kielieku kielien, zannan kielienlai bu kieliedene mafan gieku kielien kielie. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Ta goude mejie, lon kijiechen, zannanni giechen, tanxin giechenla Mexiha Hudaghalai gojiai jiachanni jienlie dane. Tanxin gieku nigiedade beiikughala niekielien wo.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gonni Kewosi Mutun Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Enezighan shiqin jiere Hudai hokuruku hhezighan kielien ulie chenliechen kunlai jiere irene. Yama oronde witu kielienghala kiema tai bu piendagha. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Ingiese ta hhelare bu hhantula. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Ta eqighandeishi kharani woma, edeshi Ezhanyi miende gon wo. Ta yan giese gonni kewosi mutun gie. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Gonni jiegoshi yanyanji gouni, gundanni, zhenni wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Ezhan bayasuku shiqinshi yan wo giezhi kaoyen gie. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Yama haochu witu, khara shiqin giesan kunlare bu hhantula, khareidene hhezighan shiqin giesan kunlai kheila. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Hhela beimiende giesan shiqinlai qiise ungien hularane. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13-14"/>Manlai chujiegheghasanshi gon wo. Gon dunda khizheghasanlai man chujieghene. Ingiese kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:13-14">"Unturasan kunya, xierei!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:13-14">Fugusanse bosizhe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:13-14">Mexiha chii zhouine."<verse eid="EPH 5:13-14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Ingiese ta xioxin giezhi gie. Aghelitu kun mutun gie, ben kun mutun bu gie. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Jihuini goude barei, edeku gonyin doghun wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Ingiese ben kun bu danlazhi Ezhanni isishi yan bikui mejie. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Jiu ochizhi bu sudo, jiu kunni hu gieghane. Khareidene Shenlinghala goyane durugha. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Shige, zanmeige, ganjin donghala nieniedene doula. Zhughesene don giezhi Ezhande doula. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Yan shiqindeliuzhe mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani niereghala chan ada Hudade mafan kielie.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zhanguiji Biereighala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Mexihai zunjiku zhugheghala nieniene shunji.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Biereila, Ezhande shunjiku mutun zhanguijidene shunji. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Mexihashi jiohuini qiorun biku mutun zhanguijishi biereini qiorun wo. Mexihashi ene beye, jiushi jiohuini jiuichen wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Jiohui Mexihade matugie shunjiku mutun biereiye yandeliuzhe zhanguijidene qingiezhi shunji.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Zhanguijila, Mexiha jiohuide orezhi goyane sheisan mutun biereidene ore. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Hhe ingiezhi giekushi Hudai kielienyi tungo giezhi usughala jiohuini waghazhi zhiguishighadene <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>famashighazhi goyadene khughoghane giezho, yama zannan jienjien chuchutu intui wizhi zhiguitu yama maobin witui gholughane giezho. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Niekielien wo, zhanguijiye beyedene oreku mutun biereidene orekuni wo. Biereidene orese goyadene orezho. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Kiemada goya beyene henjichen kun uwo, kharei guizhunde zhaogu giezhi Mexiha jiohuini zhaogu giekughala niekielien wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Matanshi hhei beye jieredu iyanzi wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>"Ingiese kun ada anasene likai giedene biereighalane hhantulazhi ghuala nie beye gholune." <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Eneshi fugie mimi wo. Bi Mexiha, jiohuighalai zhiizhi kieliezho. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Ingieliuzhe ta jien kunlaye goyadene oreku mutun biereidene ore. Biereiye zhanguijine zunji.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kewosi Ada Anarene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Kewosila, Ezhanyi miende ada ananughunne chenlie. Eneshi indanji wo. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2-3"/>"Ada anane zunji, ingiese chade gouni irezhi duyade oloncha agine." Eneshi dain giesanyi deilasan ji 1 gie minlin wo. <verse eid="EPH 6:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Adala, kesilane ho bu kughadene Ezhanni gonjiku banfa, pse sughakughala lai.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hoji Ezhanrene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Hojila, Mexihanughunyi chenlieku mutun ayi pugharaku zhugheghala shixinji duyai ezhannughunne chenlie. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Zinie kunlai bayasughane giezhi kunlai melie bu gie. Khareidene Mexihade hoji danlazhi zhughesene Hudai isii zunji. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Kunni ushilaku mutun bu giedene Ezhanne ushilaku mutun bayasuzhi gie. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Bugon hoji danlasan, ziyutu kun, Ezhan jien kun giesan gou shiqinde jianli ogikui ta jila.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Ezhanla, hojiladeneye ingiezhi giezhi hhelai pse bu ayigha. Ta hhelade asiman jiere niekozi Ezhan bikui jila. Hhe kunlade pienxin ulie giene.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ibilisighala Eghinduku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Zuihoude kielieye, ta Ezhanyi miende hhei fugie liliande kouizhi khiduzhe. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Zhan eghikude baohu gieku Hudai 1 tao jienni musi. Ingiese Ibilisini piendakui duii shidane. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Matan kunlare ese eghinduzho. Gonjisan, qienli bareisan, ene khara duyani lilian, asiman jieredu doghun ruhherlare eghinduzho. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Ingiese zhan eghikude baohu gieku Hudai 1 tao jienni musi. Ingiese ta ene doghun duyade duitoulai duizhi eghindu baludene bei shidane. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Bei undanlazhi nurundene zhendaoni pixilie, gundannii zhughei baohu gieku majia danlaghazhi musi, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>heqishighaku gouxioxini heini chan zhunbei giedene kon jiere musi. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Enense chugo pse xianxin giekuni baohu gieku banba danlaghazhi barei. Ingiese Ibilisini khantu gunjienlai man xiniegha shidane. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Jiuikui toukui danlaghazhi zho. Shenlinni boujienyi barei, eneshi Hudai kielien wo. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Yan shihoudeliuzhe Shenlinde kouizhi olon onxian giezhi xiahua gie. Enende oluzhi jinxin giezhi chan zhazhen giezhi soyuji shentulade xiahua gie.<verse eid="EPH 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Madeye oluzhi onxian gie. Bi kieliekude Huda made heshini kielien ogizhi fugie danzighala gouxioxii mimii jianjizhi minbai olugha gie. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Ene gouxioxide oluzhi mii sozilawoma, bishi Hudai daibio enbene. Bi indan kieliekui danzine fugiedaghazhi jianjigha giezhi onxian gie.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihoude Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Mii qinkon, bi yan giesanlai <char style="pn">Tuijigu</char> man tande mejieghane. Hheshi nie oresan gaijiu wo, Ezhande oluzhi shixinji giesan wiliechi wo. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Bi zhomen hhei tai hhende peizhi echighakushi bijienyi qinkonyi tande mejieghazhi tai zhughei nanranshighane giezho.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha pinnan, oreku, xianxin giekui gaijiulade ogi gie. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Ulie bienjiku zhugheghala mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihade oresan soyuji kunlade man nenjien ogi gie!<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
